    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but it’s probably just the stress right? i’ve had these feelings before when i'm overwhelmed and they always go away when i just take some deep breaths and lie down. if i go to the er now it'll just be a waste of time and money if it's just anxiety. can't i just try some calming tea or maybe a melatonin to help me sleep it off first?",
